---
Fix sq_engine_shutdown() to free all heap-allocated memory.

Currently some allocations (effects buffers, wavetable banks, sample data)
may not be freed on shutdown, causing memory leaks.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] sq_engine_shutdown() frees all effect delay/reverb buffers
- [ ] sq_engine_shutdown() frees all wavetable bank data
- [ ] sq_engine_shutdown() frees all loaded sample data
- [ ] Valgrind/ASan reports zero leaks after init+shutdown cycle
- [ ] No double-free or use-after-free

## Test Plan
- [ ] Run engine init+shutdown under Valgrind, verify 0 bytes leaked
- [ ] Run engine init+load_project+shutdown under Valgrind
- [ ] ASan leak checker: no leaks reported
